    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, i'm working on a 2022 F-150 that's having some transmission slipping issues. when i hook up the scan tool, i'm seeing a lot of irregular pressure spikes in the hydraulic circuit during the shifts. what are the most likely causes for these kinds of pressure fluctuations?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
