    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah i checked the fluid and it looks okay, not burnt or anything. but these spikes are just so random. it doesn't seem like a steady drop or a constant leak, just these sudden jumpy readings. do you think it's a physical blockage or could it be some kind of intermittent electrical interference messing with the sensor readings or the solenoid timing?",
